 a beach in Centro, Puerto Vallarta, in the Mexican state of Jalisco. The beach borders the Malecón and shares a name with one of the city's oldest hotels. Playa Camarones is to the north and Playa Olas Altas is to the south.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Rosita Beach","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Puerto_Vallarta%2C_March_2023_-_134.jpg/1280px-Puerto_Vallarta%2C_March_2023_-_134.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Puerto_Vallarta%2C_March_2023_-_134.jpg/500px-Puerto_Vallarta%2C_March_2023_-_134.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Another Believer","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Puerto_Vallarta,_March_2023_-_134.jpg"}},{"id":"puerto_vallarta_the_good_fortune_unicorn","areaId":"puerto_vallarta","name":"The Good Fortune Unicorn","category":"monument","tags":["art","photo"],"location":{"lat":20.61242,"lng":-105.23408},"visitMinutes":20,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"puerto_vallarta_the_good_fortune_unicorn","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":233,"wikiPageviews":24,"wikidataSitelinks":2,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-21"},"hashtags":["thegoodfortuneunicorn","puertovallarta"],"bestLight":"morning","summary":"The Good Fortune Unicorn is a sculpture by Anibal Riebeling, installed along Puerto Vallarta's Malecón, in the Mexican state of Jalisco. According to Fodor's, \"Its sleek and curvy shape makes it look like a natural part of the malecón.\"","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"The Good Fortune Unicorn","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Puerto_Vallarta%2C_Mexico_%28February_2024%29_-_347.jpg/1280px-Puerto_Vallarta%2C_Mexico_%28February_2024%29_-_347.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Puerto_Vallarta%2C_Mexico_%28February_2024%29_-_347.jpg/500px-Puerto_Vallarta%2C_Mexico_%28February_20